OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm 'extremely sorry' over
OL,4,Aburst pipe flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has said it is
OL,7,F"extremely sorry" for the disruption
OL,8,Fcaused by a burst pipe which led to
OL,9,Fflooding and forced people to evacuate
OL,10,Ftheir homes.
OL,12,FRepairs are under way on Prescot Road
OL,13,Fin Fairfield, Liverpool, after a water
OL,14,Fmain burst on Wednesday evening, United
OL,15,FUtilities (UU) said.
OL,17,FPeople on the neighbouring street, Elm
OL,18,FVale, were told to leave their
OL,19,Fproperties and a reception centre was
OL,20,Fset up to provide shelter.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
